flowchart LR
  Internet((Internet)) --> WAF[AWS WAF<br/>Regional Web ACL]
  WAF --> ALB[Application Load Balancer<br/>HTTP / HTTPS]

  subgraph VPC[Production-inspired VPC 10.0.0.0/16]
    subgraph AZA[Availability Zone A]
      PubA[Public subnet A<br/>ALB / NAT]
      AppA[Private app subnet A<br/>EC2 instance]
      DBA[Private DB subnet A]
      NATA[NAT Gateway A]
    end
    subgraph AZB[Availability Zone B]
      PubB[Public subnet B<br/>ALB / NAT]
      AppB[Private app subnet B<br/>EC2 instance]
      DBB[Private DB subnet B]
      NATB[NAT Gateway B]
    end
    ALB --> AppA
    ALB --> AppB
    AppA --> DBA
    AppB --> DBB
    AppA --> NATA
    AppB --> NATB
    DBA -.-> RDS[(RDS MySQL<br/>Multi-AZ in prod)]
    DBB -.-> RDS
  end

  AppA -.-> Role[EC2 IAM role<br/>SSM ManagedInstanceCore<br/>+ GetSecretValue on exact RDS secret ARN]
  AppB -.-> Role
  Role --> SSM[AWS Systems Manager<br/>Session Manager / no SSH]
  Role --> Secrets[AWS Secrets Manager<br/>RDS master secret]

  ALB --> WAFLogs[WAF logs]
  AppA --> Flow[VPC Flow Logs]
  AppB --> Flow
  Flow --> CW[CloudWatch Logs / Alarms]
  CW --> SNS[SNS topic<br/>optional confirmed email]
  CloudTrail[CloudTrail<br/>management events] --> Audit[(S3 audit bucket<br/>SSE-KMS + public access blocked)]

  classDef edge fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111827
  classDef private fill:#eaf7ee,stroke:#16a34a,color:#111827
  classDef security fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#111827
  classDef data fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#111827
  class WAF,ALB edge
  class AppA,AppB,DBA,DBB,NATA,NATB,PubA,PubB private
  class Role,SSM,Secrets,WAFLogs,Flow,CW,SNS,CloudTrail security
  class RDS,Audit data
